# Wildfire Wickerfolk's delirium (CR 207.2c, 604.1): on turn 1 Black Lotus pays for a Wheel of Fortune that puts Black Lotus (artifact),
# Wheel of Fortune (sorcery), an Ornithopter (artifact creature) and an Island (land) into Bot1's graveyard: four card types. On turn 3 the
# Wickerfolk (printed 3/2, haste) is 4/3 with trample, so Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) blocking it takes 2 lethal damage and the other 2
# trample over to Bot2 (CR 702.19b): 20 - 2 = 18. Haste lets it attack the turn it is cast.

